      "message": "Nineteen approved English GitHub replies and five English Sentry notes were posted and verified. Sixteen fixed GitHub issues are closed. Studio issue #9 remains open for the maintainer’s manual validation, and no new Studio release is claimed. The three newly opened DAG-ML dependency proposals are tracked separately below.",
