    {
      "id": "sentry-post-feedback-dispositions-20261030",
      "observed_at": "2026-10-30T07:48:38.481724+00:00",
      "title": "Sentry: historical test noise resolved; TLS and an unknown historical group remain open",
      "message": "Three groups were resolved as historical automated-test noise after documented review. This disposition does not certify a production deployment, and no events were deleted. The freshly observed 14-day searchable view reports one unresolved group, two events, three resolved groups and zero affected users. The connection/TLS case remains open pending manual validation and a Studio release. A separate historical native group has no recoverable event or diagnostic artifact; its cause and resolution remain unverified, so it is not considered resolved.",
