    {
      "id": "overnight-dag-dependency-pr-review-20261030",
      "observed_at": "2026-10-30T07:49:33.899226+00:00",
      "title": "Three new DAG-ML dependency PRs remain open; published main is unchanged",
      "message": "The new PRs opened after the earlier audit remain unmerged. PR #125 changes only a CI cache action and has 16 successful checks; it awaits separate review. PR #126 has five failed checks involving the Unicode fingerprint freeze and an outdated root lock. PR #127 has six failed checks involving incompatible Arrow versions and an outdated Python lock. Neither runtime proposal should be merged as submitted. The unchanged main branch has successful CI, version-guard and training-replay runs; these proposal failures do not establish a production regression.",
