    {
      "id": "public-final-releases-20261030",
      "observed_at": "2026-10-29T23:41:06.508428+00:00",
      "title": "Public delivery verified: Python SDK 1.4.13, Datasets 0.3.16 and R SDK 0.7.3",
      "message": "The Python SDK 1.4.13 wheel matches the artifact qualified by 12 installed Linux/Windows gates with zero skips. Its public install, native wire-version tests and real R/Python exchange passed. The published Docker image passed an actual CI container probe with the qualified native cohort. Datasets 0.3.16 is publicly verified across its release channels, including all 14 R-universe binaries; R SDK 0.7.3 has a verified source and all eight published binaries. Trained N4MM v3 exchange requires R SDK 0.7.3 or later and Python SDK 1.4.13 or later. No CRAN submission is claimed.",
