      "id": "ucph-public-regression-20261029",
      "observed_at": "2026-10-29T23:40:48.233680+00:00",
      "title": "UCPH exports: numeric targets, alignment and public native replay verified",
      "message": "The actual public SDK 1.4.13 and Datasets 0.3.16 wheels passed native PLS training, archive export and two fresh-session replays for both accepted UCPH v2 views with Float64 targets. The check preserved all 648 original rows per view, then selected one acquisition per physical vial for the 216-vial CV smoke; source bytes remained unchanged and replay matched at 1e-12. Original MAT pairing was not independently recertified: this is an explicit provenance limit of the accepted exports, not an unresolved delivery failure or a predictive-validation claim.",
